# Headless D must not acquire an owner-facing tab on either Fold display.
launch dev.omalauncher.boss/dev.omalauncher.oma.OmaChatActivity
absent Phone D
shot phone-d-cover
fold open
absent Phone D
shot phone-d-inner
fold folded
[phone] Before promotion this check is PENDING: never install this build just to test D.
[phone] After Boss promotes the bundled launcher, and while Boss is not typing: send oma msg send phone:D "Use ONLY oma-phone. First oma-phone --display bg status. Never use main. If unavailable reply RESULT: BG_UNAVAILABLE; if busy/refused reply RESULT: BUSY; otherwise take a bg screenshot and reply RESULT: READY with the exact call list and path." --title phone-d-smoke
[phone] Read the sender's mail; require D's reply-to to match, RESULT READY/BG_UNAVAILABLE/BUSY, exact calls, screenshot path or blocked reason. Confirm no Phone D tab, no main calls, and no takeover. Missing reply FAILS this step.
[phone] Send a second harmless status mail while D works; verify it waits behind the first and both replies return to their original sender exactly once.
